Subject: [PATCH] nftables: keep IPv6 pinhole identity, counters and expiry coherent

Query fresh kernel state, return missing IDs explicitly, acknowledge mutation
failures, and replace renewals atomically by handle. Retain each lease-file UID
and allocate unused IDs from surviving rules. Emit counters and protocol/family
matches for IPv6 pinholes, including extension headers.

